  "identity": "Rotund forge fuel officer in soot-black riveted armor, broad brass coal-bucket helmet with a narrow orange visor, thick leather apron, stubby iron boots. Oversized coal shovel in one gauntlet, a squat iron fuel hopper strapped to its back, a dangling red inspection cloth. Barrel belly and tiny legs, fussy overworked accountant silhouette rather than a furnace golem.",
